1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:00,956
Too much sun?

2
00:00:00,956 --> 00:00:02,639
Here's how to care for sunburn.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:06,803
Step one.

4
00:00:06,803 --> 00:00:09,690
Cool the skin with cool water or a cool shower.

5
00:00:09,690 --> 00:00:11,839
Don't use ice directly on the skin.

6
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,354
Step two.

7
00:00:13,354 --> 00:00:16,645
Soothe it with a moisturiser or after-sun lotion.

8
00:00:16,645 --> 00:00:18,190
Aloe vera gel can help.

9
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:19,598
Step three.

10
00:00:19,598 --> 00:00:20,756
Drink extra water.

11
00:00:20,756 --> 00:00:22,879
Sunburn can leave you dehydrated.

12
00:00:24,890 --> 00:00:25,449
Step four.

13
00:00:25,449 --> 00:00:28,468
Cover up and stay out of the sun until the skin heals.

14
00:00:28,468 --> 00:00:29,754
Don't pop any blisters.

15
00:00:30,890 --> 00:00:35,765
Blisters over a large area, fever or chills, dizziness, or a sunburned baby?

16
00:00:35,765 --> 00:00:36,856
Get medical care.

17
00:00:36,856 --> 00:00:40,127
And see a doctor if it's severe or isn't improving.
